{"unit_id":"MartinDelophy__dsh-timeline-studio-plugin#card-zh","repo":"MartinDelophy/dsh-timeline-studio-plugin","commit":"201ccc563bcbccac6f5a0b88fc2b138495dc6e08","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Timeline Studio for DeepSeek Harness 是面向 DSH Web 的视频工程工具插件。它注册工具供智能体检查本地 .timeline 工程、查看轨道片段与字幕、预演并应用编辑计划，以及渲染验证 MP4。修改计划可先做语义差异检查，再写入新工程。适合希望在 DSH 会话中检查和自动化编辑 Timeline Studio 项目的用户；需要本地 Timeline Studio、Node.js、项目目录配置，媒体导入和渲染需 FFmpeg 与 ffprobe。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:16-88","src/command-runner.js:58-148"]}
